{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2022-06-21 09:15:00', 'title': "THROUGH NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH BIG BROTHERS BIG SISTERS OF AMERICA, ACCESSIBILITY TO FREE INTERNET FROM T-MOBILE'S PROJECT 10MILLION IS EASIER FOR OVER ONE HUNDRED THOUSAND STUDENTS", 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, T-MOBILE (NASDAQ: TMUS) AND BIG BROTHERS BIG SISTERS OF AMERICA (BBBSA) ANNOUNCED A NEW PARTNERSHIP THAT MAKES ACCESS TO T-MOBILE'S PROJECT 10MILLION, THE UN-CARRIER'S $10.7 BILLION INITIATIVE FOCUSED ON PROVIDING STUDENTS FREE INTERNET CONNECTIVITY, EVEN EASIER. THROUGH THE COLLABORATION, THE MORE THAN ONE HUNDRED THOUSAND STUDENTS WHO ARE IN BIG BROTHERS BIG SISTERS' EXPANSIVE NETWORK OF 230 AGENCIES ACROSS 5,000 COMMUNITIES WILL BE ABLE TO LEARN ABOUT"}